    "research-index": "<div class=\"sc-repo-grid\"><div class=\"sc-repo-list\"><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Digital Grid Modernisation in Africa: Using Data, Automation and AI to Release Network Capacity</h2><p>The Global Grids Accelerator and a new IEA technology assessment have placed electricity networks at the centre of the development agenda. For African utilities, however, the highest-value digital investment is rarely the most fashionable one. StoneComms examines how meters, asset records, telemetry, remote control, grid-enhancing technologies and carefully governed AI can reduce losses, improve reliability and make existing networks work harder—without pretending that software can replace new lines, substations or solvent utilities.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-7-affordable-and-clean-energy\" title=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" aria-label=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;background-color:#FCC30B;color:#111;\">7</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-13-climate-action\" title=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" aria-label=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;background-color:#3F7E44;color:#fff;\">13</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/digital-grid-modernisation-africa-data-automation-ai-network-capacity\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/green-certified-offices-africa-investment-performance\" aria-label=\"Green-Certified Offices in Africa: Testing the Investment Case for Efficiency, Occupancy and Asset Resilience\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6abcdd9150c0bca3e5962053_stonecomms-green-certified-offices-africa-investment-performance-hero.png\" alt=\"Stylised African business district with a modern shaded office building, landscaping and older commercial buildings behind it in StoneComms teal, gold and cream.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Green-Certified Offices in Africa: Testing the Investment Case for Efficiency, Occupancy and Asset Resilience</h2><p>Across several African office markets, the divide between prime, efficient buildings and ageing secondary stock is widening. South Africa now provides a decade of evidence that green-certified offices can outperform comparable conventional assets, while newer evidence from Botswana and other markets points to stronger occupier demand for resilient, resource-efficient space. The investment question is moving beyond whether sustainability costs more to whether inefficient buildings increasingly carry an obsolescence penalty.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-11-sustainable-cities-and-communities\" title=\"SDG 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities\" aria-label=\"SDG 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD9D24;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">11</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-13-climate-action\" title=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" aria-label=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#3F7E44;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">13</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/green-certified-offices-africa-investment-performance\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/map-before-money-africa-climate-risk-decision-infrastructure\" aria-label=\"Climate-Risk Data for African Infrastructure: From Hazard Mapping to Investable Resilience\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6aa27cce4aefba74c87f9108_stonecomms-map-before-money-africa-climate-risk-decision-infrastructure-hero.png\" alt=\"Produce traders, municipal workers and residents use a shaded West African market street with trees, pale roofs and a public water point.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Climate-Risk Data for African Infrastructure: From Hazard Mapping to Investable Resilience</h2><p>Africa is gaining sharper maps of heat, flood and drought just as its cities make decisions that will shape exposure for decades. But a hazard map does not become a safer market, road, substation or neighbourhood by itself. The missing infrastructure is the chain that converts climate evidence into a named decision, an accountable owner, a financed intervention and a measured result. StoneComms proposes a Decision-Ready Climate Record for making that chain visible.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-11-sustainable-cities-and-communities\" title=\"SDG 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities\" aria-label=\"SDG 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD9D24;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">11</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-13-climate-action\" title=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" aria-label=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#3F7E44;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">13</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-17-partnerships-for-the-goals\" title=\"SDG 17: Partnerships for the Goals\" aria-label=\"SDG 17: Partnerships for the Goals\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#19486A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">17</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/map-before-money-africa-climate-risk-decision-infrastructure\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/infrastructure-with-roots-africa-nature-based-resilience\" aria-label=\"Nature-Based Infrastructure in Africa: Financing, Maintenance and Resilience Performance\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6a9ebcbb3a41987a15e23e5c_stonecomms-infrastructure-with-roots-africa-nature-based-resilience-hero-webflow.png\" alt=\"African infrastructure workers inspect a restored wetland protecting a raised road, market and distant port from floodwater.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Nature-Based Infrastructure in Africa: Financing, Maintenance and Resilience Performance</h2><p>Mangroves, wetlands, floodplains and urban green space can protect ports, roads, drainage systems and communities. Yet they are still commonly treated as environmental additions rather than working infrastructure. New African evidence makes the opportunity clearer - and exposes the institutional gap. StoneComms proposes a Living Infrastructure Contract for turning ecological protection into a financeable, maintained and accountable public service.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-11-sustainable-cities-and-communities\" title=\"SDG 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities\" aria-label=\"SDG 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD9D24;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">11</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-13-climate-action\" title=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" aria-label=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#3F7E44;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">13</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-15-life-on-land\" title=\"SDG 15: Life on Land\" aria-label=\"SDG 15: Life on Land\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#56C02B;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">15</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/infrastructure-with-roots-africa-nature-based-resilience\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/pipe-between-factories-africa-eco-industrial-parks\" aria-label=\"Industrial Symbiosis in African Industrial Parks: Shared Infrastructure and Competitiveness\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6a954261a968f81655847b0f_ChatGPT%20Image%20Aug%2031%2C%202026%2C%2009_59_06%20AM.png\" alt=\"African industrial park linking energy, water, materials, production and logistics.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Industrial Symbiosis in African Industrial Parks: Shared Infrastructure and Competitiveness</h2><p>Rwanda is preparing to expand its industrial parks while studying how Korea turned waste heat, wastewater and by-products into competitive infrastructure. The lesson is larger than circular economy. Africa's zones can lower production costs, improve resilience and satisfy tougher export standards if park operators are equipped to measure, match, contract and finance exchanges between firms. StoneComms proposes a Symbiosis Readiness Test for deciding where that promise is commercially real - and where it is still decorative.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-8-decent-work-and-economic-growth\" title=\"SDG 8: Decent Work and Economic Growth\" aria-label=\"SDG 8: Decent Work and Economic Growth\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#A21942;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">8</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-12-responsible-consumption-and-production\" title=\"SDG 12: Responsible Consumption and Production\" aria-label=\"SDG 12: Responsible Consumption and Production\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#BF8B2E;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">12</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-13-climate-action\" title=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" aria-label=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#3F7E44;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">13</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/pipe-between-factories-africa-eco-industrial-parks\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/blue-flame-chokepoint-africa-clean-cooking-resilience\" aria-label=\"Clean Cooking in Africa: LPG Dependence, Fuel Security and Household Resilience\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6a9464cc4fd7d63de103b9bf_096e0b33-7bd9-49d9-a20f-a958a89bbed3.png\" alt=\"African clean-cooking systems linking households to fuel, power, distribution and local manufacturing.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Clean Cooking in Africa: LPG Dependence, Fuel Security and Household Resilience</h2><p>Africa’s clean-cooking push is finally attracting serious money and delivering record gains. It is also concentrating risk. Liquefied petroleum gas now provides more than 70 per cent of the continent’s clean-cooking access, captured nearly half of recent summit disbursements, and remains exposed to imported-fuel prices and maritime chokepoints. The answer is not to retreat from LPG. It is to judge every clean-cooking pathway by whether households can keep using it when prices, suppliers or projects fail.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-3-good-health-and-well-being\" title=\"SDG 3: Good Health and Well-being\" aria-label=\"SDG 3: Good Health and Well-being\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#4C9F38;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">3</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-5-gender-equality\" title=\"SDG 5: Gender Equality\" aria-label=\"SDG 5: Gender Equality\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FF3A21;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">5</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-7-affordable-and-clean-energy\" title=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" aria-label=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FCC30B;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">7</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-13-climate-action\" title=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" aria-label=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#3F7E44;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">13</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/blue-flame-chokepoint-africa-clean-cooking-resilience\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/open-before-it-locks-kenya-battery-swapping-interoperability\" aria-label=\"Kenya's Battery-Swapping Market: Interoperability, Regulation and Investment Implications\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6a944dc74ed50a4d3e8b0f79_African%20E-Mobility%20Battery%20Swap%20Station(3).png\" alt=\"African electric-mobility battery swap station serving motorcycles.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Kenya's Battery-Swapping Market: Interoperability, Regulation and Investment Implications</h2><p>Kenya has entered a rare policy window: electric mobility is scaling quickly, battery swapping is becoming infrastructure rather than a product feature, and the legal framework is still being written. The strategic question is not whether one battery should win. It is which interfaces must be shared before proprietary networks become expensive to unwind.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-7-affordable-and-clean-energy\" title=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" aria-label=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FCC30B;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">7</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-11-sustainable-cities-and-communities\" title=\"SDG 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities\" aria-label=\"SDG 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD9D24;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">11</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-13-climate-action\" title=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" aria-label=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#3F7E44;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">13</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/open-before-it-locks-kenya-battery-swapping-interoperability\">Read research →</a></div></div></div></div>"
